{"author": "raymond91125", "body": "Dear all, \n\nThe proposal has been made to obsolete GO:0030641 regulation of cellular pH\nsee https://github.com/geneontology/go-ontology/issues/29164\n\nAutomatically move annotations to GO:0051453 regulation of intracellular pH if possible.\n\nExperimental annotations that need to be reviewed are here: \nhttps://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1TpfbNFF38oBXOR0_iUhLL4hdOe2IRtQcVHAkG-wLSJE/edit?gid=0#gid=0\n\nImpacted groups: \nEcoCyc\t2\nFlyBase\t3\nMGI\t4\nRGD\t5\nUniProt\t2\nWB\t1\nZFIN\t1\ndictyBase\t1\n\n** Group contacts: https://github.com/geneontology/go-site/blob/master/metadata/group-contacts.csv\n----\n\nMappings that need to be reviewed: (InterPro2GO, UniProt-Keywords, UniRule) \nNone\n\n\n\nThanks.\n", "created_at": "2026-01-28T01:49:26Z", "key": "issue", "labels": ["annotation review", "direct_ann_to_list_of_terms"], "state": "open", "state_reason": null, "title": "Review annotations to GO:0030641 regulation of cellular pH", "type": "issue", "updated_at": "2026-03-31T21:43:05Z"}
